246
00:18:09,026 --> 00:18:13,939
git clone is init, remote add, fetch,
recording origin/HEAD, creating one local

247
00:18:13,979 --> 00:18:19,142
branch with an upstream, and a checkout. A
bare clone has no fetch refspec and does

248
00:18:19,182 --> 00:18:24,220
not follow its source. A mirror follows
every ref, including deletions and forced

249
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:29,424
